  {
    "html": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --color-aged-sepia: #271a00;\n    --color-parchment: #faf8f5;\n    --color-fog: #d1cfc7;\n    --color-pure-white: #ffffff;\n    --color-moss-shadow: #7c7464;\n    --color-ash-mist: #e5e5e3;\n    --font-pplxsans: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    --font-pplxsansmono: 'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace;\n    --font-pplxserif: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n  }\n  .task-stack-wrapper {\n    width: 600px;\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    padding: 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n  }\n  .task-card {\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 20px 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .task-card:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .task-number {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-moss-shadow);\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .task-body {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-aged-sepia);\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .task-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .task-badge {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsansmono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-moss-shadow);\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .task-card.faded {\n    opacity: 0.45;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"task-stack-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"task-card\">\n    <div class=\"task-number\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"task-body\">Research the top 10 AI startups from YC's W24 batch and summarize their core products, funding, and growth metrics into a structured report.</div>\n    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"task-badge\">/query</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"task-card\">\n    <div class=\"task-number\">04</div>\n    <div class=\"task-body\">Analyze the ISM Manufacturing Index vs S&amp;P 500 YoY returns since 2000 and create an excel spreadsheet and report.</div>\n    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"task-badge\">/query</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"task-card\">\n    <div class=\"task-number\">05</div>\n    <div class=\"task-body\">Build a mobile web app for Huberman's strength protocol with exercise guides, logging, and downloadable reports.</div>\n    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"task-badge\">/query</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"task-card faded\">\n    <div class=\"task-number\">06</div>\n    <div class=\"task-body\"></div>\n    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"task-badge\">/query</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Task Cards \u2014 Workflow Step Stack",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --color-aged-sepia: #271a00;\n    --color-parchment: #faf8f5;\n    --color-fog: #d1cfc7;\n    --color-pure-white: #ffffff;\n    --color-moss-shadow: #7c7464;\n    --color-slate-edge: #121516;\n    --color-ash-mist: #e5e5e3;\n    --font-pplxsans: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    --font-pplxsansmono: 'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace;\n  }\n  .btn-group-wrapper {\n    width: 600px;\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    padding: 48px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 28px;\n  }\n  .btn-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .btn-label {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-moss-shadow);\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  /* Primary pill CTA */\n  .btn-primary {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 40px;\n    padding: 0 24px;\n    background: #d6d5d4;\n    color: #171615;\n    border: 1px solid #171615;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  /* Secondary / ghost nav button */\n  .btn-ghost {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 40px;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--color-aged-sepia);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(39,26,0,0.18);\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  /* Frosted glass button */\n  .btn-frosted {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 36px;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    color: var(--color-aged-sepia);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(39,26,0,0.14);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n  }\n  /* Monospace badge button */\n  .btn-mono {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 32px;\n    padding: 0 14px;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--color-aged-sepia);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(39,26,0,0.22);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsansmono);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n    line-height: 1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: var(--color-fog);\n    border: none;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"btn-group-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <div class=\"btn-label\">Primary CTA \u2014 pill radius</div>\n    <a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"#\">Try Computer</a>\n    <a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"#\">Try with Slack</a>\n  </div>\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <div class=\"btn-label\">Ghost / Nav \u2014 transparent with hairline border</div>\n    <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"#\">About</a>\n    <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"#\">How it works</a>\n    <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"#\">Features</a>\n    <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"#\">Get started</a>\n  </div>\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <div class=\"btn-label\">Frosted glass \u2014 over imagery surfaces</div>\n    <a class=\"btn-frosted\" href=\"#\">View report</a>\n    <a class=\"btn-frosted\" href=\"#\">Download</a>\n    <a class=\"btn-frosted\" href=\"#\">Open app</a>\n  </div>\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <div class=\"btn-label\">Monospace \u2014 code-adjacent actions</div>\n    <span class=\"btn-mono\">/query</span>\n    <span class=\"btn-mono\">/build</span>\n    <span class=\"btn-mono\">/analyze</span>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Button Group \u2014 CTA Variants",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --color-aged-sepia: #271a00;\n    --color-parchment: #faf8f5;\n    --color-fog: #d1cfc7;\n    --color-pure-white: #ffffff;\n    --color-moss-shadow: #7c7464;\n    --color-ash-mist: #e5e5e3;\n    --color-slate-edge: #121516;\n    --font-pplxsans: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    --font-pplxsansmono: 'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace;\n    --font-pplxserif: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n  }\n  .feature-wrapper {\n    width: 600px;\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    padding: 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n  }\n  .section-eyebrow {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsansmono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-moss-shadow);\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .section-headline {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxserif);\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: var(--color-slate-edge);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n    margin: 0 0 32px 0;\n  }\n  .cards-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .feature-card {\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 28px 24px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .feature-card.wide {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  }\n  .card-icon {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .card-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-aged-sepia);\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .card-desc {\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsans);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-moss-shadow);\n    letter-spacing: -0.028em;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .card-tag {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-family: var(--font-pplxsansmono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-moss-shadow);\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 3px 7px;\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    align-self: flex-start;\n  }\n  .card-image-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8e4dc 0%, #d5d0c7 100%);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"feature-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">What it does</div>\n  <h2 class=\"section-headline\">Built for every kind<br>of complex task</h2>\n  <div class=\"cards-grid\">\n    <div class=\"feature-card wide\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"2\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"8\" width=\"10\" height=\"2\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"13\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Research &amp; Analysis</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Perplexity Computer searches the web, reads documents, and synthesizes insights \u2014 then compiles everything into polished reports, spreadsheets, or slideshows ready to share.</div>\n      <div class=\"card-image-placeholder\"></div>\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">/query</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"3\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#7c7464\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\">App Building</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Scaffold and deploy full-stack web apps, dashboards, and tools from a single prompt \u2014 no engineering required.</div>\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">/build</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polyline points=\"3,13 7,8 10,11 15,4\" stroke=\"#7c7464\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Data Visualization</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Turn raw data into charts, graphs, and interactive reports that tell a clear story at a glance.</div>\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">/analyze</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Feature Card \u2014 White on Parchment",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "name": "Ghost Nav Button",
    "role": "Transparent navigation links",
    "description": "backgroundColor: transparent, color: #271a00, border: 1px solid rgba(39,26,0,0.14), borderRadius: 0px, padding: 0. Invisible container, only text and hairline border visible."
  },
  {
    "name": "Pill CTA Button",
    "role": "Primary action (Try Computer)",
    "description": "backgroundColor: #d6d5d4, color: #171615, border: 1px solid #171615, borderRadius: 40px, padding: 0 24px. Full-pill radius contrasts with 4-12px everywhere else, making CTAs unmistakable."
  },
  {
